<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Erreur · Rezilio</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            padding: 24px;
            background: #0f172a;
            color: #e2e8f0;
            font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
        }
        .box {
            max-width: 720px;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
            border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.18);
        }
        h1 {
            margin-top: 0;
            font-size: 40px;
        }
        p {
            color: #94a3b8;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        a {
            color: #93c5fd;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main class="box">
        <h1>Erreur {{ status_code|default('applicative') }}</h1>
        <p>Une erreur est survenue lors du chargement de cette page.</p>
        <p><a href="{{ path('app_default') }}">Retour à l’application</a></p>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
